---
title: "Rewrite as you turn"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Rewriting is off
    lg1: Rewriting is on
    lg2: The AI is paid
    lg3: It asks before paying more
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  s0: Off: the price is shown
  s1: Rewriting the page on screen
  s2: The AI is rewriting a paragraph
  s3: On: waiting for the next page
  s4: #36;1 paid: it asks before paying more
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you ask for a rewrite
  s1 --> s2: the next paragraph is sent to the AI
  s2 --> s0: the limit is reached, or the call fails
  s2 --> s1: the AI is paid#59; the rewrite shows
  s1 --> s3: the page is done or it stops: you turned the page
  s3 --> s0: you press Stop
  s1 --> s0: it stops: you pressed Stop
  s3 --> s1: the page arrives
  s1 --> s4: it stops: #36;1 paid since you said go ahead
  s4 --> s0: you press Stop
  s4 --> s1: you press Keep rewriting
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 orange
  class s3 blue
  class s4 purple
